; ボス演出
@ResetText
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry2,ArmR8,ArmL3,Eyes2_Angry_Open1,Mouth2_Smile_Open1
@ModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:1 Height:5.6 Rotation:"0,{ (8 / courtStandCount * 360)},0" Distance:12 Duration:0
@WaitForNextFrame

@ModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:1 Rotation:"0,{ (8.1 / courtStandCount * 360)},0" Duration:1 EaseName:OutQuad
@ShowPerspectiveStageScreen Index:1
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

@ResetText
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR6,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@ModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 Height:5.6 Rotation:"0,{ (9 / courtStandCount * 360)},0" Distance:12 Duration:0
@WaitForNextFrame

@ModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 Rotation:"0,{ (8.9 / courtStandCount * 360)},0" Duration:1 EaseName:OutQuad
@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true
@Wait WaitMode:1.5


# Judge6-12-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR6,ArmL6,Eyes2_Normal_Open3,Mouth2_Determined_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:マーゴは私に<br>罪をなすりつけるため、<br>多数の偽装工作を行った……<br>それは君たちにだってもう<br>十分にわかっているはずだ。|#0201Trial12_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR6,ArmL6,Eyes2_Normal_Open3,Mouth2_Determined_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:エマにかかってきた電話も、<br>私を陥れるための<br>陰謀だったんだ！|#0201Trial12_Hiro002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; IF 6-12-3未通過
@BeginIf Expression:Skip6_12_3flag1=true
    @GotoModified Path:.Judge_6-12-3_skip1

; @備考◆ルートA

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"で、でも……本当に<br><link=\"Objection_02_01_12_01\">ボクと話した</link><br>メルルちゃんって<br>偽物のメルルちゃん<br>だったのかな……。<br>あの声……やっぱり<br>本物だったような……。|#0201Trial12_Ema001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@GotoModified Path:.Judge_6-12-3_skip2

; ELSE条件・6-7-3通過済み

# Judge_6-12-3_skip1
; ELSE 6-12-3通過済
; @備考◆ルートB

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:たしかにボクが話したのが<br>メルルちゃんだったっていう<br>証拠はない……！|#0201Trial12_Ema002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ナノカちゃんや<br>レイアちゃんの証言とも<br>矛盾するし、<br>あれは偽物のメルルちゃんで<br>間違いないはずだよ！|#0201Trial12_Ema003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

# Judge_6-12-3_skip2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Normal_Open3,Mouth2_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:疑いのきっかけはレイアの聞いた<br>ガラスの割れた音だ。<br>死体発見の４０分前に<br>現場でした音……<br>それはメルルの<br>真の死亡時刻を<br>示していたんだよ。|#0201Trial12_Hiro003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; IF 6-12-4未通過
; @備考◆ルートA
@BeginIf Expression:Skip6_12_4flag1=true
    @GotoModified Path:.Judge_6-12-4_skip1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR5,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……しかし、あれは本当に<br>聞こえた音だったんだろうか。<br>私にしか聞こえなかった<br>かすかな音なんて……。<br>改めて考えると、<br>私の<link=\"Objection_02_01_12_02\">幻聴</link><br>だったんじゃ……。|#0201Trial12_Leia001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@GotoModified Path:.Judge_6-12-4_skip2

; ELSE 6-12-4通過済
# Judge_6-12-4_skip1
; @備考◆ルートB

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ヒロくんの言う通りさ。<br>そのとき、<br>マーゴくんがメルルくんを<br>殺していた……<br>そう断言させてもらうよ。|#0201Trial12_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ENDIF 分岐終了

# Judge_6-12-4_skip2

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes2_Angry_Open1,Mouth2_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:マーゴはさらに、<br>魔法でガラスの音を真似した。<br>……立体音響として<br>周囲に響かせ、<br>ナノカが音を聞いた方向を<br>誤認させるために。|#0201Trial12_Hiro004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

